    31	4	automation-bias	Automation bias — overseers deferring to automated recommendations including wrong ones — is an established empirical finding	Parasuraman & Manzey, "Complacency and Bias in Human Use of Automation", Human Factors 52(3), 2010; Skitka et al. 1999	checked-by:claude:2026-08-16
